  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Project Owner Secret Variables Contract",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "description": "Contract only; routes, D04 typed writes, migrations and production binding are not implemented by this schema. Initialized Project current Human Owner only; no administrator bypass. Active writes, initialized archiving/archived metadata reads and completed history/replay; pending/deleting reject. Shared variable IDs/names, immutable type secret and stable hidden CredentialRef. No plaintext read endpoint, value fingerprint, length, mask or CredentialRef in responses. Each explicit value replaces encrypted material even when equal; metadata-only exact no-op preserves version and emits no facts. Referenced variables cannot be deleted. Original request/detail/receipt/Lookup limit 1 MiB; list 5 MiB; strict UTF-8 byte caps, duplicate keys, scalar validity and cross-field invariants are enforced in Go. Unknown retains original command/attempt; not_observed is not rollback proof. Agent F1, MCP and Runner material use remain separately unbound."
  },
